descriptions.job-1ckakyp:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is the company bringing global finance onchain. Backed by over $1 billion in capital, we are the premier digital asset infrastructure provider trusted by thousands of industry-defining financial institutions, including banks, payment providers, fintechs, and global corporates such as BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Western Union, Stripe, and Revolut. Built for institutional scale and security, our enterprise-grade platform and network have powered over $14 trillion in digital asset transfers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Location: Singapore&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Fireblocks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Fireblocks is an enterprise-grade platform providing secure infrastructure for moving, storing, and issuing digital assets. Through the Fireblocks Network and MPC-based Wallet Infrastructure, we help financial institutions securely build, run, and scale their digital asset operations — protecting assets from cyber-attacks, internal collusion, and human error. Fireblocks is a recognized leader in digital asset infrastructure, trusted by institutions worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; The Customer Success Manager is responsible for building and maintaining relationships across a portfolio of customers, enabling them to realize value from the Fireblocks platform. As a trusted advisor, you will leverage your domain expertise to drive adoption, proactively resolve risk, and secure renewals across your book of accounts. You will work closely with Sales, Support, Product Management, and the broader Customer Success team to ensure customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a portfolio of customers, applying scalable, repeatable playbooks to drive adoption efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish regular touchpoints to track progress against adoption goals and technical objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify targeted key accounts within your portfolio and partner with the commercial team to grow those accounts through upsell and expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trusted advisor relationships with key stakeholders across your portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer product usage data into actionable guidance for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor customer health scores and predictive risk indicators to flag and resolve at-risk accounts proactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For targeted key accounts, provide contract utilization pacing and deeper account reviews as part of regular check-ins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support deployment and operational best practices across all customer communication channels, including email, web calls, Slack, and mobile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-departmentally to resolve common integration issues and surface recurring customer problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply customer health scoring and risk management fundamentals to prevent and resolve risk at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive communication and customer advocacy to ensure a consistent customer experience across the portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree with 1–3 years of experience in Account Management, Customer Success, or a related SaaS/tech role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level proficiency in English is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level proficiency in additional APAC languages (e.g., Mandarin, Korean, Japanese) is not mandatory, but considered a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort and familiarity with AI tools to drive efficiency in account management, reporting, and customer communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort managing a portfolio of accounts efficiently, using scalable processes over highly bespoke engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate business requirements into business value, and collaborate with Sales to promote value-driven solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in technical account management, or supporting customers on complex/technical platforms, is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets You Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An out-of-the-box thinker who finds creative, scalable solutions to serve a large portfolio efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong personal drive to grow your book of business and take ownership of portfolio-level outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1fwxy8x:
&lt;p&gt;Since we opened our doors in 2009, the world of commerce has evolved immensely, and so has Square. After enabling anyone to take payments and never miss a sale, we saw sellers stymied by disparate, outmoded products and tools that wouldn’t work together.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;So we expanded into software and started building integrated, omnichannel solutions – to help sellers sell online, manage inventory, offer buy now, pay later functionality, book appointments, engage loyal buyers, and hire and pay staff. Across it all, we’ve embedded financial services tools at the point of sale, so merchants can access a business loan and manage their cash flow in one place. Afterpay furthers our goal to provide omnichannel tools that unlock meaningful value and growth, enabling sellers to capture the next generation shopper, increase order sizes, and compete at a larger scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, we are a partner to sellers of all sizes – large, enterprise-scale businesses with complex operations, sellers just starting, as well as merchants who began selling with Square and have grown larger over time. As our sellers grow, so do our solutions. There is a massive opportunity in front of us. We’re building a significant, meaningful, and lasting business, and we are helping sellers worldwide do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Channel Expansion Manager leads the delivery of our third party sales channels — Independent Consultants and Resellers — across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role has two equally important halves. One is launching channels in new markets. The other is taking the channels we already have, many of them still immature and manually run, and making them streamlined and ready to scale. That second half means finding where a channel is breaking down, building the processes that don&#39;t yet exist, and fixing the operational problems that cap how fast a market can grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a planning role. You&#39;re the connective tissue between Channel Sales and every function expansion depends on — and you&#39;re judged on what actually ships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re someone who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builds where there&#39;s nothing&lt;/strong&gt; – You&#39;re a structured thinker who thrives in ambiguity and is comfortable designing a process from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ships and fixes&lt;/strong&gt; – You take more satisfaction in landing a change than in writing the plan for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Is commercially curious&lt;/strong&gt; – You want to know what&#39;s driving the numbers, not just what the numbers are&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gets things done through others&lt;/strong&gt; – You deliver through teams you don&#39;t manage, and you&#39;re good at it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Is tenacious&lt;/strong&gt; – You&#39;ll chase, challenge, and push for a decision rather than wait for one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operates independently&lt;/strong&gt; – You&#39;re proactive and highly organized, and you don&#39;t need to be managed closely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling existing markets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio of improvement programs that take early-stage, manually run channels and make them scalable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose where a channel is breaking down using performance data, partner feedback, and frontline input — separating root causes from symptoms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, document, and implement the processes that don&#39;t yet exist across partner onboarding, deal registration, lead routing, escalation, and support handoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove the manual workarounds, bottlenecks, and single points of dependency that cap growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise the improvement backlog by impact on partner productivity, revenue, and operational risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Land changes properly: train the teams affected, document the new way of working, and confirm the fix has held&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Launch delivery &amp;amp; market readiness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the end-to-end delivery of channel launches, translating expansion decisions into live sales channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn agreed priorities into executable market plans with clear owners, milestones, dependencies, and dates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn the channel proposition into a market-ready go-to-market plan covering target partner profile, recruitment, onboarding, and enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate everything needed to go live — partner collateral, training, incentive mechanics, and support models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close out market-specific regulatory, legal, and compliance requirements with Legal, Risk, and Compliance, including partner contracting and due diligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hand over cleanly to the teams running each market day to day, and feed learnings back into the global playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating model, systems &amp;amp; data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Sales Support and Tooling to decide how the channel should run operationally — onboarding workflows, deal registration, quoting, commission and payout, contract administration — then partner with Sales Operations, Finance, and the regions to implement it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the reporting that gives leadership visibility of partner pipeline, activation, and productivity by market and channel, working with F&amp;amp;S and Data Science to build it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface risks to channel targets early, working with the regions who own their pipeline and forecast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alignment &amp;amp; unblocking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the single point of coordination for channel expansion across Product, Sales, Operations, Finance, Legal, Risk, Compliance, Marketing, and Enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line up the stakeholders each programme depends on, secure their commitment, and hold them to agreed deliverables and dates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify blockers early, resolve them directly where you can, and escalate with a clear recommendation where the decision sits above you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broker trade-offs between competing functional priorities, and communicate progress, risks, and results to senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Input into the analysis behind market-level pricing, commission structures, and incentive models with Channel Sales, Product, and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research market and competitor channel programs, turning insight into decision-ready recommendations and business cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop new ideas into briefs that frame the opportunity, the options, the commercial case, and your recommendation — to a standard that can go to GTM leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in sales operations, business operations, program management, or channel-related roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience designing and implementing commercial processes from scratch, and improving processes that aren&#39;t working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of diagnosing operational problems and delivering fixes that stuck — ideally somewhere scaling quickly or lacking existing structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to run multiple complex, cross-functional programs concurrently and to a deadline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen and analytical skills, with confidence working across performance data and financial models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting market entry or international expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with channel sales models, partner programs, or indirect distribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with commission, incentive, or partner payout processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in technology, payments, financial services, or platform-based businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across multiple European markets, or across APAC and the US, and comfort working across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work environment &amp;amp; conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Head of Expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Individual contributor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coverage:&lt;/strong&gt; All third party channels — Independent Consultants and Resellers — across all markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London United Kingdom&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hours:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time, with flexibility required to work across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equipment:&lt;/strong&gt; Computer and necessary software provided&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every market we open and every partner we sign depends on someone making the channel actually work — the onboarding that doesn&#39;t stall, the deal registration that doesn&#39;t get lost, the launch that goes live on the date it was promised. That&#39;s this role. If you like walking into something half-built and leaving it running properly, this one&#39;s for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1ywuqn5:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a passionate Integration Engineer to join our Card Team. You&#39;ll be the primary technical point of contact for our clients, guiding them through API integrations, debugging issues, and handling essential technical setups. Your work will directly contribute to faster client onboarding and higher client satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Integration Engineer Team Lead and works closely with Software Engineers, Product Managers, and external client technical teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and support clients step-by-step through API integration for card issuing from initial sandbox setup to full production go-live acting as their primary technical point of contact throughout and beyond&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Routinely debug and diagnose technical issues within both sandbox and production environments, working directly with clients to identify root causes and implement solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and execute technical configuration tasks including identity provider setup, access control, and payment network portal configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage payment network certification processes for mobile wallet integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain clear technical documentation, troubleshooting playbooks, and internal knowledge base content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in client-facing communication channels (Slack, WhatsApp) to provide timely first-line technical support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate client feedback and integration challenges into actionable Jira tickets for our Software Engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage generative AI tools and monitoring platforms for troubleshooting, documentation, log analysis, and root cause identification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Sales, Product, and Engineering teams to ensure a seamless client experience from engagement through integration and beyond&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in a technical client-facing role (integration support, solutions engineering, technical account management, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with RESTful APIs - reading documentation, testing endpoints, debugging request/response payloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills in both English and Chinese (Mandarin) are essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ticketing systems (FreshDesk, Zendesk, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read logs and trace issues through distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured troubleshooting approach - logical reasoning from error codes to root cause&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with generative AI tools for daily productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership mentality - proactively identifies and resolves issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fintech or payment industry experience (card issuing, acquiring, e-wallet)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with VISA/Mastercard protocols or card lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with monitoring tools (DataDog, Grafana)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of webhook architectures and event-driven systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating SOPs or runbooks for support operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-1612929:
&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://stripe.com/payments/link&quot;&gt;Link&lt;/a&gt; helps Stripe&#39;s merchants deliver frictionless and secure checkout experiences by auto-filling customers&#39; payment information, letting customers check out in seconds and pay in one click across the Link merchant network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Link Balance team is building on top of that network to transform Link from a one-click checkout into a global consumer financial platform. Link Balance lets consumers hold, spend, earn rewards on, and off-ramp digital dollars—stored as stablecoins, powered by Bridge and Privy, and distributed through Stripe&#39;s network of hundreds of millions of consumers. We&#39;re bringing the borderless, programmable, and instant utility of digital dollars into everyday use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Staff Software Engineer to lead the design and delivery of new money-movement capabilities in Link. You will take ambiguous product opportunities and turn them into reliable, scalable, and intuitive experiences for consumers and merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on individual-contributor role with broad technical and organizational scope. You will own large, cross-functional projects from early product and technical definition through launch and iteration; lead teams of engineers through complex execution; and partner closely with the many Stripe systems and teams that make money movement possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across the stack, building services and APIs as well as the user experiences that expose those capabilities. The work may involve modern financial infrastructure—including stablecoin-enabled capabilities—while requiring sound judgment around safety, reliability, compliance, and user trust. You will make the architectural decisions that let the balance model scale globally, and raise the engineering bar for the team as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical strategy, architecture, and execution for large, ambiguous Link initiatives that create new money-movement primitives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own projects end to end: clarify the problem, define an incremental technical plan, align stakeholders, drive delivery, launch safely, and use results to guide further investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build robust, scalable backend services and high-quality consumer-facing experiences across Java, Ruby, and TypeScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a project team of engineers through execution, creating clarity on priorities, decisions, risks, and delivery milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Design, Data Science, Risk, Infrastructure, and other Stripe teams to build capabilities that are safe, reliable, and useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate dependencies across Stripe’s payments and money-movement platforms, making thoughtful tradeoffs between speed, user experience, operational reliability, and durable technical foundations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the engineering bar through technical leadership, design reviews, mentoring, and constructive feedback across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the team’s longer-term roadmap by identifying opportunities, technical risks, and investments needed to scale Link’s financial capabilities globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of backend and/or full-stack software development experience, with a track record of owning large, ambiguous systems end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated technical experience leading the design and delivery of large, complex software projects from early definition through production launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong full-stack engineering skills, including experience building reliable backend services and polished user-facing product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and unblocking a group of engineers on a substantial project as a senior individual contributor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate effectively in high-ambiguity environments: framing problems, making durable technical decisions, and creating an actionable path forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional and cross-organizational collaboration skills, with the ability to align teams with different systems, priorities, and constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering judgment around system reliability, operational excellence, security, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product-minded approach to engineering, with a focus on delivering meaningful outcomes for users and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Java, Ruby, and/or TypeScript. We care more about strong engineering fundamentals and the ability to learn than expertise in a particular language or framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building payments, money-movement, fintech, or other regulated financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building consumer products at scale, particularly products that require a high degree of user trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on 0→1 products or taking new capabilities from concept through launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with stablecoins, digital assets, or the infrastructure that enables global financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appreciation for the importance of good documentation—internal and external—and taking pride in seeing projects through to successful completion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-1sc09ep:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;NGIRdneo3o65z5xJsgSu6eOxsbb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusOs6rZxImwP0eSwMTFv21Jh&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus6YGpWWBVPsamPS6lpYAhRc&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Leader&lt;/strong&gt; to join our technology leadership team, reporting directly to the CTO. This role will &lt;strong&gt;manage and grow the Platform Product organization&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;extend product ownership across the CTO-line platform product portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;, including infrastructure-facing product lines such as AI platform, compliance infrastructure, financial cloud, and developer tooling.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus7WDb035yJDEStbecubFHGh&quot;&gt;This is a rare opportunity to shape the product strategy of a global crypto exchange at a pivotal inflection point — transitioning from a high-growth crypto-native platform to a &lt;strong&gt;regulated, AI-native financial institution&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-doxusdcWZFEK0yplbZZIq1MrKPf&quot; data-type=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusYbS4rPaFjGqIEsebvJdNxg&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxus0dEI0ZpBmaQKv9iuzbYmmf&quot;&gt;1. Platform Product Organization Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuscZZtvT9wGqn78hSEKecYLh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Directly manage and develop the Platform Product Group — a 15+ person team spanning compliance site building, payments &amp;amp; assets, CRM, user/security/reach, personalization, and AI product lines&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusNJRstchZ77sbFwj4Jnmdim&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive team health, OKR quality, and delivery rigor across 10+ sub-teams and 200+ active requirements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusGtm8sjdlEMjPoiuKwnXIoc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build a high-performance product culture: elevate product thinking from requirement-taking to systems-level ownership; enforce outcome-based OKRs over go-live checklists&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusg0G2lep1RaLQiqcQQeAugm&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Recruit, develop, and retain senior product talent; proactively manage succession and capability gaps&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxusv3ElzZOX4OnLMp0owzaYce&quot;&gt;2. CTO-Line Platform Product Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus0GWXMaVSvca2S3zmCDGhYg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the product vision and roadmap for &lt;strong&gt;CTO-line platform product lines&lt;/strong&gt;, including:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxLJhiK3xM4FIOOGs0ZeaIf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Platform&lt;/strong&gt; (OpenClaw, AI Gateway, AI Sub-Account, Skills Marketplace, AI Coding infrastructure)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusWA69GKXcthox4MYfO8fP0c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Cloud / Compliance &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; (self-service compliance platform, multi-jurisdiction site building, regulatory data export)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusYBvBCELLVc1IeWy7OiRSUg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer Experience &amp;amp; Internal Tooling&lt;/strong&gt; (BDOT, CI/CD product layer, AI-native R&amp;amp;D workflow)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusAjv6TvVOIdOdA46TfUZb6m&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Intelligence Platform&lt;/strong&gt; (knowledge distillation, MCP integration, personalization engine)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuslirJBbYKi6SKFrVJrb4UUb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate CTO-level technical strategy into concrete product roadmaps with measurable business outcomes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxusYtB3kaGvNZYwbhcBKuf1td&quot;&gt;3. AI-Native Product Transformation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusESYUu5PiAMJxBAYfjuRnuf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the platform product team&#39;s transition to &lt;strong&gt;AI-native product development&lt;/strong&gt; — 100% AI documentation coverage, AI-assisted requirement analysis, and measurable AI efficiency gains&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus5BLNOqBR9Ei70LRr3b9t5f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Define and drive the &lt;strong&gt;killing feature strategy&lt;/strong&gt; for the AI agent platform: identify the user acquisition hook that converts infrastructure investment into real user growth&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusRtj3p3pDtztrdtGy31BImh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the product strategy for intelligent customer service evolution — from reactive article-linking to proactive, fully automated resolution (&amp;gt;80% resolution rate target)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-doxusIFXA4UhsF1R0WkQJyTbqth&quot; data-type=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusnqyEGpVHfZR8ofK77BVEgm&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxus4xl1jEXVGYGFRJwGif1Fdd&quot;&gt;Must Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusNOtVWiRZRN2kzI9j2Y1y1g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of product management experience, with at least &lt;strong&gt;5 years in a senior product leadership role&lt;/strong&gt; managing multi-team product organizations (20+ PMs)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxush3FOFnpVO2x9IdxjdGqGMb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven track record building and shipping &lt;strong&gt;platform/infrastructure products&lt;/strong&gt; — not just consumer-facing features; experience with developer platforms, internal tooling, or B2B SaaS is highly valued&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuss8MOLQgLuKJA23FCko5WGf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;systems thinking&lt;/strong&gt;: ability to define product architecture, module catalogs, and API contracts — not just user stories&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusByr0NHnHFOWeauvouCHX3b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience operating in a &lt;strong&gt;regulated or compliance-heavy environment&lt;/strong&gt; (fintech, banking, crypto, or equivalent); understanding of how regulatory requirements translate into product constraints and opportunities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusbMq3Pa1Symm7V1bXuUG7vm&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Demonstrated ability to &lt;strong&gt;drive OKR quality&lt;/strong&gt; — moving teams from go-live metrics to outcome-based measurement&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusNc1wNhhnvxh938GdfnyAMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fluency in &lt;strong&gt;Chinese (Mandarin)&lt;/strong&gt; — required for internal communication with engineering teams and business stakeholders&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxusps9vDW2S9ElnY9MSXU8zvh&quot;&gt;Strongly Preferred&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus81m6vCTdfEVk3Bx3WlhTOh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;AI product strategy&lt;/strong&gt; — agent platforms, LLM-powered products, or AI infrastructure products&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusUmXWVakLotoTA1xq1PS81g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Background in &lt;strong&gt;financial services technology&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;crypto/Web3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusSf2QdRvn7UHosSuL2BlGMm&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience managing product teams through &lt;strong&gt;organizational restructuring&lt;/strong&gt; or rapid scaling&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus21h5HLYxrOHfvBCtnwy3Em&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;multi-jurisdiction compliance&lt;/strong&gt; product challenges (KYC/KYB, AML, regulatory data reporting, multi-site architecture)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusUN6uxsGrN26QaHxjCiwbMm&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Track record of &lt;strong&gt;defining and launching platform &quot;killing features&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; — not just maintaining existing product lines&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxus91PdIfQgMXmj35iJayK6Kb&quot;&gt;Leadership Profile&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusBNtv1HcYeSjHeA1PDbHZod&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end ownership mindset&lt;/strong&gt;: bridges customer pain points, product design, system architecture, data governance, compliance, and business outcomes — not a handoff-oriented PM&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusBdcOqjk3uCtlfcmnd9cMph&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prioritization discipline&lt;/strong&gt;: can narrow scope to the top 5 problems and communicate a clear, credible plan rather than attempting to map everything simultaneously&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus7Znr7ZBKtkfvKDS4HtEcrg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Honest communicator&lt;/strong&gt;: acknowledges unknowns directly; gives specific, actionable feedback to senior engineers and PMs&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusfTKgA8oUtSmF09kisXdAgd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder, not coordinator&lt;/strong&gt;: avoids absorbing accountability for all cross-team AI products without authority; focuses on creating genuine new product value&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1ozpdwh:
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;Founded 20 years ago and headquartered in Chicago, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Group of financial services firms has grown to more than 600 people operating throughout North America, Europe and Asia. Since spinning out of a large brokerage firm in 2016, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; Trading has rapidly scaled as an independent proprietary trading firm utilizing its own capital, trading strategies, and risk management methodologies to provide liquidity to worldwide financial markets and hedging opportunities to commodity producers and users. Now, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; group affiliates include two broker dealers, a cryptocurrency market making firm, and a bourgeoning investment adviser.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Overview: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;We are building out the next generation of our proprietary electronic trading platform — a greenfield, event-based trading and market data system covering pricing, execution, and risk management — and we are looking for a senior C++ engineer to help lead that effort. You will design and build the systems our trading desks depend on every day: ultra-low-latency execution engines, market data pipelines, order and risk management, and direct connectivity to the world’s major futures and commodities exchanges. This is a hands-on senior role on a small team with broad ownership across the trading stack — the code you write goes to production and trades real markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Lead the design, implementation, and deployment of DV Commodities&#39; core C++ trading platform: execution, order management, market data, pricing, and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Design and maintain direct exchange connectivity — order entry gateways and feed handlers for venues such as CME (iLink 3 / MDP 3.0), ICE, and other futures and commodities markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Drive microsecond- and nanosecond-level performance work: lock-free data structures, cache-aware design, kernel-bypass networking, CPU pinning and NUMA tuning, and rigorous latency measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Work directly with trading desks on new feature requests, pricing, and execution algos, and with quants and developers on cross-functional teams to troubleshoot and solve complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Build high-performance components for both simulation and live trading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;Own systems end to end — design, implementation, testing, deployment, and production support in a live trading environment.&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db73e6d3f6c4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional C++ development, with deep command of modern C++ (17/20), templates, move semantics, memory models, and concurrency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building low-latency, high-throughput, multi-threaded systems for quantitative trading — ideally at a proprietary trading firm, market maker, hedge fund, or exchange.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of how exchanges work: order types, matching engine behavior, market microstructure, and native exchange protocols (e.g., iLink/MDP, native ICE, FIX/SBE).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with futures and/or commodities markets; energy markets (crude, refined products, natural gas) and swaps a strong plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems-level fluency: Linux/Unix environments, git, TCP/UDP and multicast networking, kernel-bypass stacks (Onload, VMA, DPDK, or similar), and performance profiling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience with distributed systems, large data sets, and SQL, NoSQL, or tick databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to program in a scientific computing environment (Python/NumPy/pandas) for research and tooling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills; sound judgment in production trading environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher in CS, Engineering, or another technical discipline, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;748&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1ac93e0b889c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus eligibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HSA, FSA, and Dependent Care Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer Paid Group Term Life and AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voluntary LTD, Life &amp;amp; AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Vacation policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement plan with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is not accepting unsolicited resumes from search firms. Only search firms with valid, written agreements with &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; should submit resumes in response to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;’s posted positions. All resumes submitted by search firms to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; via e-mail, the Internet, personal delivery, facsimile, or any other method without a valid written agreement shall be deemed the sole property of &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;. &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The range below reflects the expected base salary for this position. It represents a good-faith estimate of the base pay we anticipate offering, with actual compensation determined by your experience, education, skills, and performance throughout the interview process. This role is also eligible for a discretionary bonus (at DV Trading&#39;s discretion) and DV Trading&#39;s benefits package, including the benefits listed above.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$250,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-15p8o2p:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is the company bringing global finance onchain. Backed by over $1 billion in capital, we are the premier digital asset infrastructure provider trusted by thousands of industry-defining financial institutions, including banks, payment providers, fintechs, and global corporates such as BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Western Union, Stripe, and Revolut. Built for institutional scale and security, our enterprise-grade platform and network have powered over $14 trillion in digital asset transfers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to join the fast-paced world of navigating the shifting landscape of regulations for cryptocurrency and DeFi? We’re looking for an experienced Technical&amp;nbsp; Support Engineer to join a newly formed APAC Support team. As a Technical Support Engineer, you will deal with the most challenging and complex problems in the Defi and Web 3.0 space. You will support Fireblocks&#39;s continued hyper-growth and work closely with many teams, including Site Reliability, DevOps, Product and Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our Technical Support Team operates on a 24/7 basis 365 days out of the year, including all major holidays which are paid overtime. APAC Technical Support Engineers will cover 5 days weekly, might include one day over the weekend and the Shift could start at 6:30am (no night shifts).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning problems through to resolution using all available resources at your disposal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide real-time support using Slack and remote troubleshooting during APAC timezone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver best-in-class technical support for Fireblocks&#39;s SaaS platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate technical issues to the Senior Support Team as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Senior Support team during outage situations and participate in war room calls&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption and adherence to business processes and policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Since the Technical Support team is our first line of defence, The expectation is to handle customer queries and escalations professionally with meticulous case management and documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3-5 years experience as a Technical Support Engineer (or a similar role)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under high pressure and troubleshoot with effective time management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work ethics/ability to work unorthodox hours in case needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API implementation and debugging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both oral and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent troubleshooting and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or fluent Japanese and English language skill&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/BA degree in Computer Science or equivalent field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience supporting SaaS-based products or relevant experience in financial services, technology, and/or technical support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mandarin or another language depending on your actual customer base (Korean, Japanese, Bahasa)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Databases, Kibana, Grafana, OpenSearch, Scripting (Python/Perl/Bash/Javascript) or LogStash&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cryptographic algorithms utilized by public blockchain networks (e.g., elliptic curve, symmetric and public key cryptography, hashing, and other cryptography-related topics)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0uhcoo1:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is the company bringing global finance onchain. Backed by over $1 billion in capital, we are the premier digital asset infrastructure provider trusted by thousands of industry-defining financial institutions, including banks, payment providers, fintechs, and global corporates such as BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Western Union, Stripe, and Revolut. Built for institutional scale and security, our enterprise-grade platform and network have powered over $14 trillion in digital asset transfers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fireblocks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;, the industry-leading digital asset infrastructure technology company responsible for 15% of all crypto transactions!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is an enterprise-grade platform delivering a secure infrastructure for moving, storing, and issuing digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. At Fireblocks, we enable businesses to securely build, run and scale digital asset operations through the Fireblocks Network and MPC-based Wallet Infrastructure. Our next-generation multi-layer technology protects Digital assets from cyber-attacks, internal collusion, and human error. Fireblocks is the only platform that provides insurance for digital assets in storage, transfer, and E&amp;amp;O.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As of January 2026, we serve over 2400 institutional customers, have secured the transfer of over $10 trillion in digital assets, and are the world&#39;s highest-valued digital asset infrastructure company, with over $1 billion raised.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is simple: Enable every business to easily and securely support digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. Come join us as we&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Secure. Simplify. Scale&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about the opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fireblocks, we&#39;re replatforming financial services onto a new blockchain-based tech stack. We invite you to be a cornerstone in this journey as our Business Solutions Director for EMEA. In this high-impact role, you will join forces with our Enterprise Accounts team to guide leading Payment institutions through transformative digital infrastructure solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Consulting &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serving as a trusted advisor to C-level executives and business leaders in the Payments sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboratively develop business cases for early-stage digital initiatives, securing executive buy-in for transformative projects in the digital asset space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage large, cross-organizational business solutions and consulting assignments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Enterprise Accounts team to close large strategic accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interfacing with the Product Strategy and Go-to-Market teams to contribute actionable insights that shape our future product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Research&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging in groundbreaking market research and thought leadership to bolster Fireblocks’ reputation as an industry innovator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating internal market research reports and external thought leadership materials to share valuable insights and promote dialogue within the industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Fireblocks&#39; intellectual capital through the development of digital asset solution frameworks, tools, and templates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Team Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fostering close relationships with our business leads, product, sales, marketing, and R&amp;amp;D teams to deliver holistic, best-in-class solutions to our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in top-tier management consulting or financial services, particularly in payments or financial services strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must Have: 3+ years of hands-on experience with blockchain and digital assets (Institutional Custody, Tokenization, Trade Finance, CBDCs etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to distill complex digital asset opportunities into digestible insights for non-crypto audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in PowerPoint/Google Slides and adept at crafting persuasive executive presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational abilities with a track record of managing multiple concurrent projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead teams indirectly and foster an atmosphere of collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for client success and driven to optimize business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to take ownership, coupled with a ‘roll-up-your-sleeves’ work ethic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BE/ BTech / BA / B.Sc. in Business, Statistics, Economics, or other quantitative fields. MBA is strongly preferred but not a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-16or869:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Localcoin, founded in 2017 with headquarters in Toronto, is on a mission to simplify the process and experience of buying or selling digital currencies globally. We envision bringing digital currency to the mainstream financial market through partnerships with leading corporate and franchised retail spaces. With terminals across Canada, Poland and the APAC region, including Australia, Hong Kong, and New Zealand, Localcoin is now the fastest growing Bitcoin ATM operator in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At its core, Localcoin believes that everyone should be able to own cryptocurrency and have a deep understanding of blockchain technology. As a member of our rapidly growing team, you&#39;ll join a talented, dynamic group of team members who will encourage you to learn, grow, and thrive in your career every step of the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re a self-starter looking to hone your skills in a scale up environment that fosters innovation, transparency, and team connectivity, we look forward to hearing from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $115,000 - $130,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Product Manager to lead our integrations and platform product initiatives while helping shape the next generation of products for our business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for a technically fluent product manager who enjoys working closely with Engineering, understands complex product ecosystems, and can translate strategic direction into clear product execution. Initially, you will focus on managing the product roadmap for our integrations team. As you become more familiar with the business, customers, and technical architecture, you will also support new product initiatives aligned with our company strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not be solely responsible for inventing new product ideas from scratch. However, once promising opportunities are identified, you will help evaluate them, define MVP scope, estimate product and engineering tradeoffs, and drive execution from concept through prototype and launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an ideal opportunity for a Product Manager who enjoys working in a highly technical environment and is eager to expand their impact into broader product leadership over time. The role is hybrid, with in-office collaboration at our Etobicoke office every Wednesday and Friday.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BE DOING&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product roadmap for our Integrations team, balancing customer needs, business priorities, technical constraints, and delivery timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering to define requirements, prioritize work, resolve tradeoffs, and ship high-quality integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong understanding of our technical architecture, crypto-related product surface area, customers, partners, and market dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional stakeholders to gather requirements, clarify priorities, and ensure alignment across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate ambiguous product needs into clear problem statements, product requirements, MVP definitions, and execution plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new product initiatives once opportunities have been identified by helping evaluate feasibility, expected impact, build costs, risks, and success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise leadership with clear product recommendations, including tradeoffs, assumptions, risks, and implementation paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead approved new product initiatives from concept through prototype, working closely with Engineering and other stakeholders to deliver a working product within expected timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics for integrations and new product initiatives, and use data, customer feedback, and market insights to guide product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure new products are not only built, but also positioned for successful adoption, iteration, and long-term impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE’RE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as a Senior Product Manager, with 5–6+ years of overall product management experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product management experience in a technical environment, ideally focused on platforms, integrations, infrastructure, fintech, cryptocurrency, or developer tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cryptocurrency, blockchain technology, and digital asset transaction flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with compliance and regulatory requirements, including KYC, AML, and MSB regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to own a product area end-to-end, from discovery and prioritization through execution and launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working closely with Engineering on technically complex products, including APIs, integrations, system architecture, partner dependencies, and infrastructure-related tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success balancing product strategy, roadmap planning, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with SQL and business intelligence tools such as Tableau, Looker, or Power BI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to align cross-functional teams and clearly articulate product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-moving environment where adaptability, ownership, and initiative are essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias toward ownership, clarity, and execution in ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with crypto, blockchain, digital assets, DeFi, wallets, exchanges, custody, payments, or related technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience managing integrations with external partners, APIs, protocols, platforms, or technical vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a startup or high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching 0-to-1 products or new product lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with executive teams on product strategy, opportunity evaluation, or investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background or prior experience working on deeply technical products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL LOVE ABOUT US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Benefits – We value and reward our team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RRSP Group Matching Program – We invest in your financial well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Work Environment – Enjoy flexibility while being part of a dynamic team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Development – Opportunities for learning and growth covered by Localcoin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Culture &amp;amp; Events – Regular socials, team meetings, and collaborative workspaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impactful Work – Play a key role in a growing company and make a real difference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great Place to Work® Certified – Proudly recognized for our positive workplace culture and employee experience 3 years in a row.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOIN OUR INCLUSIVE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Localcoin is committed to building an inclusive, accessible, and equitable workplace. We welcome applicants from all backgrounds and do not discriminate based on race, ancestry, place of origin, color, ethnic origin, citizenship, creed, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, age, marital status, family status, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require accommodation at any stage of the recruitment process, please notify the Talent team or email &lt;strong&gt;careers@localcoinatm.com&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be legally eligible to work in Canada. At this time, we are not able to provide visa sponsorship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI DISCLOSURE STATEMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to share that we may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to help screen and assess applications. While technology helps us stay organized and efficient, every hiring decision at Localcoin is made by real people who care about finding the best addition to our team. These tools are used to support our process—not to replace the human judgment and connection that are core to our culture.&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-001neap:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Strategic Program Lead on the International CX Strategic Programs team within the Customer Experience org, you&#39;ll ensure customer experiences are globally relevant, locally compliant, and regionally optimized across APAC, EMEA, and the Americas. You&#39;ll work horizontally across product domains and with regional partners to adapt, localize, and scale initiatives, bringing the CX perspective into launch planning so regional customers are never an afterthought.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own regional launch readiness by ensuring every product or policy launch is adapted for local markets, including language, payment methods, regulatory coverage, and agent enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface and prioritize region-specific friction by monitoring emerging issues and themes, elevating local trust-breaking patterns to Program Managers and Product teams with clear paths to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt global programs for local context by partnering with Program Managers and Product teams to customize policies, workflows, and automation where regulatory requirements or cultural behaviors differ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional CX, Ops, Risk, and Compliance leads to align on local experience quality, legal requirements, and proactive mitigation of market-specific risks, including producing monthly SLA reports for regulated entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent regional customers in global forums, ensuring roadmap discussions, launch planning, and issue prioritization reflect the needs of customers across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in program management within customer support operations, including hands-on work with technical product or ops integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use quantitative analysis and regional data to prioritize issues, inform launch decisions, and measure CX outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of operating across multiple regulated markets (e.g., EMEA, APAC) with working knowledge of compliance requirements such as AML/KYC, vulnerable customer obligations, or financial services regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering cross-functionally with Product, Engineering, Compliance, and Operations teams to drive programs from planning through execution across multiple geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$108,630&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$108,630 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-09y4v4x:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Account Management team at Bridge is dedicated to the growth, retention, and expansion of key customers. Our Scaled Account Management team focuses on driving measurable expansion across a broad portfolio of mid-market and high-growth customers through data-driven strategies, efficient processes, and strong cross-functional partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Scaled Account Manager at Bridge you will own a book of existing accounts and be responsible for expanding revenue, identifying product gaps and driving product adoption, preventing churn and ensuring renewals at scale. You will combine consultative selling with volume playbooks, prioritization based on quantitative signals, and hands-on execution to identify and close upsell opportunities across your territory. As Bridge continues to develop within Stripe’s Money Management organization, you will also drive your customers’ adoption of additional features available through Stripe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Own a book of existing accounts and drive revenue growth through additional usage, upsells, cross-sells, and renewals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Develop and execute scalable go-to-market strategies that increase revenue per account and accelerate product adoption across your portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Use data and quantitative analysis to prioritize accounts and identify the highest-impact expansion opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Generate leads through targeted outreach, research, and campaign execution; manage high-velocity deal cycles from qualification to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Build strong relationships with customer stakeholders to understand business priorities, surface pain points, and tailor Bridge solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Lead commercial negotiations and renewals to expand and retain customer revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Identify churn signals in your book and implement strategies to prevent revenue losses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Coordinate with product, success, risk, and operations teams to solve complex customer needs and ensure a great user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Translate customer feedback into actionable product and process improvements to better serve scaled customer segments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-5–8 years of full sales cycle or account management experience focused on existing business accounts; experience managing a large book of accounts or high-velocity portfolio strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Strong analytical skills with experience using data to prioritize accounts, build business cases, and track outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Comfortable understanding technical product requirements and articulating solutions across multiple technology products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Demonstrated ability to close upsell opportunities and manage complex pricing or commercial negotiations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Excellent operational acumen and proven ability to manage time and prioritize across a high-volume territory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Highly motivated, persistent, and effective in ambiguous, fast-paced environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Superior written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Willingness and ability to work in-office in New York or San Francisco at least three days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Previous experience at a high-growth payments, fintech, crypto, or technology company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Experience with CRM tools, Excel, and basic SQL or a demonstrated comfort with data tools and analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Background in working cross-functionally with product, risk, and operations teams to deliver outcomes for customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Bridge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join a team that values clear thinking, quantitative rigor, and customer obsession. At Bridge you’ll own meaningful customer outcomes, operate with autonomy, and have the opportunity to shape how we scale revenue across high-potential accounts.&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-1h1lzoh:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gemini is a global crypto and Web3 platform founded by Cameron and Tyler Winklevoss in 2014, offering a wide range of simple, reliable, and secure crypto products and services to individuals and institutions in over 70 countries. Our mission is to unlock the next era of financial, creative, and personal freedom by providing trusted access to the decentralized future. We envision a world where crypto reshapes the global financial system, internet, and money to create greater choice, independence, and opportunity for all — bridging traditional finance with the emerging cryptoeconomy in a way that is more open, fair, and secure. As a publicly traded company, Gemini is poised to accelerate this vision with greater scale, reach, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Department: Tooling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Principal Software Engineer (Product)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Product Engineer, you&#39;ll set technical direction for the customer-facing platform that defines how millions of users experience Gemini — onboarding, compliance, customer support, and the systems that hold the customer journey together. This is a role for an engineer who operates at the level of the technology itself: someone accountable for company-level initiatives, who drives the hardest technical challenges across organizational boundaries, and who creates the architectural vision that other teams build against.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across backend, web, and mobile, but your leverage comes less from what you build directly than from the direction you set, the leaders you grow, and the frontier you push. We treat AI-assisted development and automation as first-class — an agentic SDLC pipeline where agents plan, implement, and review work through our harness under human gates. As a Principal, you&#39;re expected to shape where that frontier goes, define the patterns and operational guidelines other engineers adopt, and advance how the whole organization builds. If you&#39;re energized by owning ambiguous, company-critical technical bets and multiplying the engineers around you, we&#39;d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is required to be in person twice a week at our New York City, NY office.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical vision and architecture for the customer-facing platform, designing for scale and reliability with a multi-year horizon and anticipating needs before they arrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review critical designs across organizations and drive the designs for projects involving the hardest technical challenges at the company; act as a key driver of demos and technical direction beyond your own team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for one or more core company initiatives spanning onboarding, compliance (KYC/identity), and customer support — carrying them from ambiguity through production and long-term operation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify strategic direction in technology and product, proposing and adopting architecture and platform approaches that advance it; tie technical bets clearly to company objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and deliver large, complex, cross-org programs with interdependencies across teams and systems, spanning months to years; identify the problems worth solving and advocate for their prioritization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define patterns, operational guidelines, and engineering practices for your vertical(s), and extend process improvements across teams and command pilot units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide critical technical guidance proactively — raising the security, reliability, and quality bar across the organization, and debugging or contributing to the most complex parts of a system when needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical multiplier: mentor and develop engineers and future leaders, share knowledge, delegate to grow others, and lead initiatives across domains, including outside your core area of expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the organization toward a strategic vision for strong systems, sustainable practice, and healthy engineering culture; play a critical role in recruiting and bar-raising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of software engineering experience building and operating complex production systems at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized expertise in one or two core technical domains, with a track record of being accountable for company-level systems or initiatives end to end.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of driving architecture and design for the hardest technical challenges across multiple teams or organizations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to set technical vision with company-level impact and to bring an increasingly strategic mindset to engineering decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency across multiple layers of the stack (backend services plus web and/or mobile) and willingness to go deep wherever a problem requires.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in a typed language (e.g., TypeScript, Scala, Java, Go) and comfort with JavaScript/TypeScript on web and mobile surfaces.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building consumer-facing applications with strong product and UX sensibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in using AI coding tools and automation, and a point of view on how to advance an agentic development practice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of acting as a technical multiplier — developing engineers and leaders, influencing prioritization across teams, and leading cross-domain initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, including the ability to communicate complex technical issues to diverse audiences and build alignment across organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the crypto or fintech industry, or as a user of crypto products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with onboarding, identity/KYC, compliance, or customer support tooling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting and operating AI agents or agentic workflows in production at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with React/React Native and cloud/microservices architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of driving product and technical strategy with data and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience representing engineering externally (talks, writing) or in cross-company technical collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;It Pays to Work Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;The compensation &amp;amp; benefits package for this role includes:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive starting pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A discretionary annual bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Long-term incentive in the form of a new hire equity grant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;401K with company matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;: The base salary range for this role is between $192,500 - $275,000 in the State of New York. This range is not inclusive of our discretionary bonus or equity package. When determining a candidate’s compensation, we consider a number of factors including skillset, experience, job scope, and current market data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In the United States, we offer a hybrid work approach at our hub offices, balancing the benefits of in-person collaboration with the flexibility of remote work. Expectations may vary by location and role, so candidates are encouraged to connect with their recruiter to learn more about the specific policy for the role. Employees who do not live near one of our hubs are part of our remote workforce. All employees, however, are required to onboard in-person at one of our office locations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Gemini, we strive to build diverse teams that reflect the people we want to empower through our products, and we are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, or Veteran status. Equal Opportunity is the Law, and Gemini is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. If you have a specific need that requires accommodation, please let a member of the People Team know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-19v7ash:
&lt;p&gt;It all started with an idea at Block in 2013. Initially built to take the pain out of peer-to-peer payments, Cash App has gone from a simple product with a single purpose to a dynamic ecosystem, developing unique financial products, including Afterpay/Clearpay, to provide a better way to send, spend, invest, borrow and save to our 50+ million monthly active customers. We want to redefine the world’s relationship with money to make it more relatable, instantly available, and universally accessible.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, Cash App has thousands of employees working globally across office and remote locations, with a culture geared toward innovation, collaboration and impact. We’ve been a distributed team since day one, and many of our roles can be done remotely from the countries where Cash App operates. No matter the location, we tailor our experience to ensure our employees are creative, productive, and happy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Science team at Block turns unique customer and product data into decisions that expand access to financial services. Our Lending team powers decisioning behind Cash App Borrow, Afterpay, Square Loans, and the next generation of first-party credit products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Product Data Scientist to help build, measure, and improve credit products that serve customers traditional credit systems often miss. You’ll partner closely with product, engineering, and risk teams to define metrics, evaluate experiments, understand customer behavior, and turn ambiguous product questions into clear decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an agentic data science role. You’ll use AI tools and agent workflows to move faster and think more rigorously across the full data science loop: exploring messy datasets, building pipelines, stress-testing hypotheses, evaluating product changes, and turning analysis into decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex product, customer, and risk data into clear insights, decision frameworks, and durable measurement systems for product, risk, and business partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools and agent workflows to improve both the speed and quality of analytical work, from accelerating exploration and automating repetitive tasks to generating hypotheses and stress-testing conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end execution across analysis, metrics definition, experimentation, forecasting, visualization, and decision support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain measurement frameworks for credit products, including customer eligibility, repayment behavior, product usage, loss performance, funnel health, and long-term customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with risk teams to evaluate model and policy performance, monitor cohorts, identify bias or drift, and connect risk decisions to product and business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and analyze experiments, rollouts, and policy changes that shape customer access, repayment outcomes, and product growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approach ambiguous product and risk questions from first principles, using statistical judgment to define the right cohorts, metrics, and decision criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate insights clearly to technical, product, and business stakeholders, including risk partners and senior decision-makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical direction and standards for the Block Data Science team - making and building consensus on key technical decisions, and creating reusable frameworks, measurement templates, and scalable tooling that remove complexity for others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive localized cross-team impact by connecting measurement and insights across Lending products (Borrow, Afterpay, Square Loans) and partnering with senior stakeholders in product, engineering, and risk to align Data Science work with broader strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and grow the team by developing junior data scientists, fostering a culture of analytical rigor and psychological safety, and contributing to hiring through interviews and calibrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree in statistics, data science, economics, computer science, or a similar quantitative field with 12+ years of experience in a relevant role OR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A graduate degree in statistics, data science, economics, computer science, or a similar quantitative field with 6-8+ years of experience in a relevant role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency with SQL and experience building clear, decision-oriented data visualizations&lt;/li&gt;
