&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AkS2dUf2Yo4oZ7xYhRNlR0pbgNg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-I4C0dMP69o9ArlxwulflmUF2gcd&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTApdC2haopFIsxTIavllhxxgpa&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VQnjd1sNBok3oNxfg12lFLcog1R&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand for hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AoB3d9rAUo2SJexvTPhlNiwcgRd&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;strong&gt;We Before Me, Do the Right Thing, and Get Things Done.&lt;/strong&gt; These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NObRdlIFGo4RDkxRH4NlEgBWgTd&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of blockchain to users around the world through leading products including OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink, and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-HUVTds0CLol2tVxMxHsl2a15gpc&quot; data-type=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MXCfdlckMoWu5Ix275glBS41gF7&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOo3d0PZMo5RNgxP8O0lB7Jkgeg&quot;&gt;As part of the Institutional Relationship Management team, you will serve as the primary point of contact for our institutional partners. Your mission is to cultivate long-term relationships, drive revenue growth through proactive sales and strategic engagement, and ensure a seamless operational experience for institutional clients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RiK8dERZ6o8cVYxfJnJlA2FrgKb&quot;&gt;This role sits at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;institutional sales, client relationship management, and product collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;, acting as a bridge between client needs and internal product capabilities. Performance will be evaluated through a balanced KPI framework focused on &lt;strong&gt;growth, new business development, and client service excellence&lt;/strong&gt; to support sustainable revenue generation and operational quality.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-SyW9dy4W5oU4mNxZ6LLlBlUdgvg&quot; data-type=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-E1zYdQLOboemmDxneLhlIIJcgud&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-T9MgdI6Q4oVO8OxlP5TlEzwuggc&quot;&gt;Business Development &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GqMCd16p5oxEl9xOFtglkbSfgNe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify and qualify new institutional leads, managing the full sales cycle from initial outreach through to closing and post-sales client success.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EyPodX8fMoZWuYxUP7elMp3Xgcd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coordinate the end-to-end onboarding process for institutional clients, including verification and account activation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SjH0dDl1PojkAXxjMYdlCjRhg7e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Monitor client activity and trading patterns to identify opportunities for upselling and cross-selling.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GW1odsWqkoBcsrxN0g0lYAuogHb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop strategic initiatives to expand institutional client relationships and drive trading activity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-T5mGdDEipoeJu3xKUXSl5l4lgMb&quot;&gt;Product &amp;amp; Relationship Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MYWKdj3xQoVWfuxcmfWlhgp1gEg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Serve as the dedicated relationship lead for assigned institutional accounts, resolving day-to-day inquiries and operational issues within defined SLAs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DalJdzcW3oZLo0x1S4slJ23fgbb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proactively educate clients on new product launches, platform features, and market developments to support optimal platform usage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JYfgdpU5EohqULxBp0WlNZcngSc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Analyze client feedback and operational challenges, identifying meaningful signals that can drive product improvements and commercial outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZFFodq9F3oIE5pxzYb0lcHckgge&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop deep expertise in OKX’s product suite, trading infrastructure, and risk framework to provide informed guidance to institutional clients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SwPvdwDmhoDmIIx5tT4lTbj7gXb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage dedicated client communication channels (Slack, Telegram, WhatsApp, WeChat) and coordinate with internal teams including Product, API, Legal, and Compliance to deliver solutions and improvements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IWa6dsqYwoJ1OOxYJNrlHlcagFh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Advocate internally for initiatives that enhance client experience, increase trading activity, and support long-term client retention.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-JhEodvQRzo22UqxfAkxlWLUbgLf&quot;&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KSqVd5FZ0o2qKExBJltlvZy2god&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure all client engagements strictly adhere to company policies, Terms of Service, and local regulatory requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PPL6dpUSeo8YzCxViIulV4upgSm&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support due diligence processes including DDQs, partnership agreements, and audit requests in collaboration with Legal and Compliance teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RjG8dzxU6oeWYHx3EUBlNG35gpH&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain high standards of documentation, operational transparency, and regulatory alignment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-QDCXdyXHdotZK8xSRXWlhIETgeh&quot; data-type=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-XgZOdDV95ohEcsxZiZJlPM6IgAb&quot;&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ZxdNd8EhioUAEdxNuoBlsIn9gde&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L2i1d39WjoyaJlxiN4Fl0ePQgyF&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Finance, Economics, or a related field.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
