&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgNpCbDmxBjc86h8s1nNaWFb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of mentoring senior engineers and raising the technical bar.&lt;/div&gt;
