&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgBGiy1Hhbz71hkM6iv4s00b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor&#39;s degree or higher in Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/div&gt;
